ys rugby supports that sport. Missing credibility metadata is not wrong_argument. Return direct only for the requested relation; UK Albums Chart does not define the band or song whose debut is mentioned.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the population of St. Paul, Texas?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0098-94d178aca62d:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 3, \"text\": \"St.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0098-94d178aca62d:d00\", \"start\": 4, \"end\": 34, \"text\": \"Paul, Collin County, Texas St.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0098-94d178aca62d:d00\", \"start\": 35, \"end\": 89, \"text\": \"Paul is a town in Collin County, Texas, United States.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0098-94d178aca62d:d00\", \"start\": 90, \"end\": 166, \"text\": \"The population was 1,066 at the 2010 census, up from 630 at the 2000 census.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0098-94d178aca62d:d00\", \"start\": 167, \"end\": 170, \"text\": \"St.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0098-94d178aca62d:d00\", \"start\": 171, \"end\": 217, \"text\": \"Paul is located in southern Collin County at .\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0098-94d178aca62d:d00\", \"start\": 218, \"end\": 283, \"text\": \"It is bordered to the west, south, and east by the city of Wylie.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0098-94d178aca62d:d00\", \"start\": 284, \"end\": 318, \"text\": \"The city of Lucas is to the north.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0098-94d178aca62d:d00\", \"start\": 319, \"end\": 426, \"text\": \"According to the United States Census Bureau, the town has a total area of , of which , or 0.34%, is water.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0098-94d178aca62d:d00\", \"start\": 427, \"en